# Swarmer: small, low, angular. Ink wedge body, one red eye (danger), blade fins.
grid 5
size 28 20 14
slot body Ink
slot trim Steel
slot eye Danger
# wedge body: pointed nose toward +x
poly 3 10 body 2,4 18,2 27,10 18,18 2,16
poly 10 12 body 6,6 18,5 24,10 18,15 6,14
# blade fins on the back
poly 10 13 trim 3,9 9,9 6,10 3,11
beam 5 4 8 2 0 2 1 trim
beam 5 16 8 2 20 2 1 trim
beam 14 3 7 14 0 1 1 trim
beam 14 17 7 14 20 1 1 trim
# eye
box 23 8 7 27 12 10 eye
mirror y
